  "root_idea": {
    "summary": "The root centers on one thing facing, turning toward, or standing opposite another.",
    "development": "From the basic notion of facing or orientation develop meanings of front, direction, approach, reciprocal encounter, acceptance, social grouping, and—more distantly—the temporal relation expressed by قَبْلُ, before.",
